---
/**
 * 手写页（迁移自 en/guides/index.html，源码即产物 → Astro 源文件）。
 * 语言：en；标记注入区已改为 frontmatter 函数调用（同一数据源/同一公式）；
 * 联盟/广告占位注释原样保留，构建后由 placement 状态机重写。
 */
import Layout from '../../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<Layout title={"LLM API Cost & Model Selection Guides | Reflex Hub"}
  desc={"Guides to LLM API cost calculation and model selection: the cost formula with a worked example, same-usage pricing comparison across Chinese and international models, and monthly cost scenarios for chatbots, RAG and coding agents. All data from official vendor list prices, reproducible step by step."}
  ogDescription={"Cost calculation, pricing comparison and scenario cost guides built on one verifiable data source."}
  canonicalPath="/en/guides/"
  active="guides"
  jsonld={[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"AboutPage","name":"LLM API Cost & Model Selection Guides","url":"https://www.reflex-hub.com/en/guides/","inLanguage":"en","description":"Guides to LLM API cost calculation, pricing comparison and scenario-based cost estimation."},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.reflex-hub.com/en/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Guides","item":"https://www.reflex-hub.com/en/guides/"}]}]}
  crumb={"/ Guides"}>
  <Fragment slot="bodyend" set:html={"\n\n  <script>window.ASSETS_BASE = '../../assets';</script>\n  <script src=\"../../assets/app.js\"></script>"} />
<section class="hero">
      <h1>LLM API cost &amp; model selection guides</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Calculate with confidence · compare fairly · estimate accurately</p>
    </section>

    <p class="lede">
      All published guides share one verifiable data source (models.json) and one calculation basis —
      from "know how to calculate" to "know how to compare" to "know how to estimate": formulas and a worked example
      in the cost guide, whole-market price differences at fixed assumptions in the pricing comparison, and
      business-scenario parameters in the cost-scenarios guide.
    </p>

    <h2 class="group-title">API cost calculation</h2>
    <nav class="module-grid" aria-label="API cost calculation">
      <a class="module-card active" href="llm-api-cost/">
        <h3>How to calculate LLM API costs</h3>
        <p>Input/output tokens, cache read-write and hit prices, context-length tiers, peak/off-peak handling, price units and multi-currency conventions, monthly usage assumptions with a reproducible worked example, and common mistakes around unknown prices and cross-vendor comparisons.</p>
        <span class="go">Read the guide →</span>
      </a>
    </nav>

    <h2 class="group-title">Model pricing &amp; comparison</h2>
    <nav class="module-grid" aria-label="Model pricing and comparison">
      <a class="module-card active" href="llm-api-pricing-comparison/">
        <h3>LLM API pricing comparison</h3>
        <p>Estimated monthly costs for 17 mainstream models under identical usage: official list prices per 1M tokens in the original currency, cache prices, context windows, a CNY-converted ranking, and how to read the table for model selection.</p>
        <span class="go">Read the guide →</span>
      </a>
    </nav>

    <h2 class="group-title">Scenario cost cases</h2>
    <nav class="module-grid" aria-label="Scenario cost cases">
      <a class="module-card active" href="llm-api-cost-examples/">
        <h3>Monthly cost scenarios</h3>
        <p>Monthly costs for three scenarios — chatbot/customer service, RAG knowledge-base Q&amp;A and coding agents — with explicitly labeled assumptions, per-model estimates, cache-hit-rate sensitivity and swap-in-your-own-parameters recalculation.</p>
        <span class="go">Read the guide →</span>
      </a>
    </nav>

    <h2 class="group-title">AI automation workflows</h2>
    <nav class="module-grid" aria-label="AI automation workflows">
      <a class="module-card active" href="make-llm-workflow/">
        <h3>Build an LLM automation workflow with Make</h3>
        <p>A five-part architecture for calling model APIs from a visual iPaaS (trigger → modules → HTTP call), concept-level steps and failure handling, plus a per-1,000-runs cost table computed from official list prices and retry-amplification analysis (documentation research, not hands-on testing).</p>
        <span class="go">Read the guide →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="module-card active" href="workflow-automation-choose/">
        <h3>Make, n8n or a custom API: choosing a workflow platform</h3>
        <p>A six-dimension decision framework across deployment, data residency, cost structure, operations and lock-in; unverified vendor pricing is labeled as such, and no product is declared the winner.</p>
        <span class="go">Read the guide →</span>
      </a>
    </nav>

    <section class="panel">
      <h2>Companion tools and conventions</h2>
      <div style="font-size:14px;line-height:2">
        <p>
          · <a href="../cost/">Cost calculator</a>: enter your real usage and compare any selection of models side by side;<br>
          · <a href="../models/">Model library</a>: a pricing profile per model with official sources; <a href="../compare/">Model comparison</a>: two models line by line;<br>
          · Data conventions (original currencies, tiers, reference rates, verification dates) are documented in the <a href="../pricing-methodology/">pricing methodology</a>;<br>
          · All guides are also available <a href="../../guides/">in Chinese</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
